# The entry-exit into CJ's house in Grove Street (CARLS: the outside marker at 2495.33,-1690.75,13.78, 1.4 x 1.4,
# no ambient peds inside). Run with PAWN_DEFINES=NO_ENEX=1 (DisableInteriorEnterExits in OnGameModeInit) and
# without: with the entry-exits on, stepping onto the marker takes the player inside (the server sees
# "[cov] interior id=N 0->3"); disabled, there is no marker and the player stays in the street.
#   SAMP_LOCK=enex.lock SAMP_PORT=7943 CMDS=tools/e2e/samp/enex.cmds tools/e2e/samp/mod-join.sh OUT
#   LANE=7 CMDS=tools/e2e/samp/enex.cmds tools/e2e/samp/samp-rs-ab.sh DLL_DIR NAME
pos|2495.33|-1686.5|13.5|180
time|12
sleep|4
shot|enex-door
pos|2495.33|-1690.75|13.9|180
sleep|10
shot|enex-step
